{"id":"51427999-8fe3-4959-83e0-56a929a45c7b","object":"chat.completion","created":1793238740,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"\n\n<｜｜DSML｜｜ calls>\n<｜｜DSML｜｜ invoke name=\"write_note\">\n<｜｜DSML｜｜ parameter name=\"title\" string=\"true\">environ.py descriptor mechanisms</｜｜DSML｜｜ parameter>\n<｜｜DSML｜｜ parameter name=\"content\" string=\"true\">environ.py: EnvVar descriptor: __set_name__ registers descriptor into _descriptors dict; __get__ caches into owner __dict__ so first read wins; conversion exceptions wrapped as type(e)(f'{self.name}: {e}'). Factory methods build config items (e.g. boolean/int). rearm(name) and rearm_all() reset the cache so next read reparses env. To add DEEPINFER_LOG_MAX_MESSAGE_CHARS: add factory method (e.g. def log_max_message_chars(self)) validating int >=32, empty/invalid/too small raise ValueError mentioning variable name; result None when unset. Default logger init reads cached config once.</｜｜DSML｜｜ parameter>\n<｜｜DSML｜｜ parameter name=\"evidence_ids\" string=\"false\">[\"ev-8554ade850ecb397d235\", \"ev-246c6e73a88cb2c9edc3\", \"ev-ef45633e339c9e5fd82f\"]</｜｜DSML｜｜ parameter>\n<｜｜DSML｜｜ parameter name=\"section\" string=\"true\">source-note</｜｜DSML｜｜ parameter>\n</｜｜DSML｜｜ invoke>\n</｜｜DSML｜｜ calls>"},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":6555,"completion_tokens":278,"total_tokens":6833,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":5504},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":5504,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":1051},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}